      "editorial_notes": "Shared workplace foundation. This unaccepted coordinated repair retains collect.gather.v for intentionally gathering items from several people or places into one group. The example uses one completed form from each team, replacing the former reception-pickup example. Proposed editorial difficulty is B1: Oxford gathering A2 and Collins gathering B1 are kept distinct, with no level borrowed from pickup, hobby collecting or a page footer. The general region is retained for the gathering use; pickup regional guidance does not restrict this sense. The revised pending image brief must show multiple sources becoming one set. The exact whole-entry hold remains historical; independent language/context, picture-suitability, morphology and audio decisions remain pending. Retaining declared practice modes is not release or visual acceptance. Source consultation does not approve the dependent expression, a complete module or any professional procedure."
